%% Idempotency System - Data Flow Diagram
%% Story: PAY-010
%% Date: 2025-10-25

sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Middleware as Idempotency<br/>Middleware
    participant Repository as Idempotency<br/>Repository
    participant Database as PostgreSQL<br/>idempotency_cache
    participant Handler as Payment<br/>Handler

    Note over Client,Database: First Request (No Cache)
    Client->>+Middleware: POST /api/lightning/invoice<br/>Header: Idempotency-Key: uuid-1234<br/>Body: {amount: 10000}
    Middleware->>Middleware: Validate UUID format
    Middleware->>Middleware: Compute SHA-256 hash<br/>of request body
    Middleware->>+Repository: findByKey(uuid-1234)
    Repository->>+Database: SELECT * FROM idempotency_cache<br/>WHERE idempotency_key = uuid-1234
    Database-->>-Repository: No rows found
    Repository-->>-Middleware: null (cache miss)
    Middleware->>+Handler: Process payment request
    Handler-->>-Middleware: {invoice: lnbc..., amount: 10000}
    Middleware->>Middleware: Intercept response.json()
    Middleware->>+Repository: store(uuid-1234, hash, response)
    Repository->>+Database: INSERT INTO idempotency_cache<br/>(..., expires_at = NOW() + 24h)
    Database-->>-Repository: Success
    Repository-->>-Middleware: true
    Middleware-->>-Client: 201 Created<br/>{invoice: lnbc..., amount: 10000}

    Note over Client,Database: Duplicate Request (Cache Hit)
    Client->>+Middleware: POST /api/lightning/invoice<br/>Header: Idempotency-Key: uuid-1234<br/>Body: {amount: 10000} (same)
    Middleware->>Middleware: Validate UUID format
    Middleware->>Middleware: Compute SHA-256 hash
    Middleware->>+Repository: findByKey(uuid-1234)
    Repository->>+Database: SELECT * FROM idempotency_cache<br/>WHERE idempotency_key = uuid-1234
    Database-->>-Repository: Row found (not expired)
    Repository-->>-Middleware: {response_body, response_status, ...}
    Middleware->>Middleware: Compare request hashes
    Note over Middleware: Hashes match ✓
    Middleware-->>-Client: 200 OK (from cache)<br/>Header: X-Idempotency-Cached: true<br/>{invoice: lnbc..., amount: 10000}

    Note over Client,Database: Request Body Changed (Error)
    Client->>+Middleware: POST /api/lightning/invoice<br/>Header: Idempotency-Key: uuid-1234<br/>Body: {amount: 20000} (CHANGED)
    Middleware->>Middleware: Validate UUID format
    Middleware->>Middleware: Compute SHA-256 hash
    Middleware->>+Repository: findByKey(uuid-1234)
    Repository->>+Database: SELECT * FROM idempotency_cache<br/>WHERE idempotency_key = uuid-1234
    Database-->>-Repository: Row found
    Repository-->>-Middleware: {response_body, request_hash_old, ...}
    Middleware->>Middleware: Compare request hashes
    Note over Middleware: Hashes DON'T match ✗
    Middleware-->>-Client: 500 Internal Server Error<br/>{error: "Idempotency check failed"}

    Note over Client,Database: Automatic Cleanup (Background)
    loop Every 1 hour
        Middleware->>+Repository: cleanupExpired()
        Repository->>+Database: DELETE FROM idempotency_cache<br/>WHERE expires_at < NOW()
        Database-->>-Repository: Deleted 42 rows
        Repository-->>-Middleware: {deleted_count: 42, duration_ms: 50}
    end
